flowchart LR
  Domain["Domain transaction"]
  Pending["PostgreSQL outbox<br/>pending and available"]
  Leased["leased<br/>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED<br/>attempt incremented"]
  QueueAdd["BullMQ add<br/>jobId = eventId-handlerVersion<br/>retained job"]
  Published["outbox published<br/>lease cleared"]
  Retry["retry scheduled<br/>available_at moved<br/>lease cleared"]
  Terminal["terminal outbox event<br/>dead letter recorded"]
  Waiting["BullMQ waiting or active"]
  Handler["Versioned durable handler"]
  Existing{"Job result already exists for<br/>eventId and handlerVersion?"}
  Return["Return persisted result<br/>skip repeated side effect"]
  Effect["Perform handler work<br/>append follow-up outbox events if required"]
  Result["Insert one work_job_results row<br/>unique event and handler version"]
  WorkerRetry["Throw transient failure<br/>BullMQ retry and backoff"]
  WorkerDead["Unrecoverable or exhausted<br/>dead letter and terminal result"]

  Domain -->|same database commit| Pending
  Pending -->|relay claim| Leased
  Leased -->|queue accepted| QueueAdd
  QueueAdd --> Waiting
  QueueAdd -->|ack with current lease token| Published
  Leased -->|queue unavailable and attempts remain| Retry --> Pending
  Leased -->|attempts exhausted| Terminal
  Waiting --> Handler --> Existing
  Existing -->|yes| Return
  Existing -->|no| Effect --> Result
  Handler -->|transient error| WorkerRetry --> Waiting
  Handler -->|typed terminal error or final attempt| WorkerDead

  QueueAdd -. "relay dies before ack: lease expires and the same jobId is added again" .-> Pending
